msgid "Qiskit v2.0 migration guide {#qiskit-v20-migration-guide}"
msgstr "Panduan migrasi Qiskit v2.0 {#qiskit-v20-migration-guide}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0 is the next step within the Qiskit SDK's newly stabilized life cycle.\n"
"This major version does break compatibility with previous versions of Qiskit, but,\n"
"in contrast to the v1.0 release, doesn't involve any changes in the packaging structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0 adalah langkah berikutnya dalam siklus hidup Qiskit SDK yang baru distabilkan.\n"
"Versi mayor ini memang memutus kompatibilitas dengan versi Qiskit sebelumnya, namun,\n"
"berbeda dengan rilis v1.0, tidak ada perubahan dalam struktur paketnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes migration paths for the most important feature changes in Qiskit v2.0, organized by module.\n"
"Use the table of contents on the right side to navigate to the module you are interested in.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menjelaskan jalur migrasi untuk perubahan fitur terpenting di Qiskit v2.0, diorganisasikan per modul.\n"
"Gunakan daftar isi di sisi kanan untuk navigasi ke modul yang kamu butuhkan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v2.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca lebih lanjut tentang manfaat Qiskit v2.0 di [blog "
"IBM&reg;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-2-0-release-summary).\n"

