# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Removal of legacy `c_if` conditions {#removal-of-legacy-c-if-conditions}"
msgstr "Penghapusan kondisi `c_if` lama {#removal-of-legacy-c-if-conditions}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Classical conditions in Qiskit have been preferentially represented by the instruction [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) since before Qiskit v1.0.\n"
"These operations are typically added to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) by using the [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) method as a context manager.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kondisi klasik di Qiskit sudah lebih direpresentasikan oleh instruksi [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) sejak sebelum Qiskit v1.0.\n"
"Operasi-operasi ini biasanya ditambahkan ke [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) menggunakan metode [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) sebagai context manager.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This also means that the "
"[`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction)"
" no longer has a `condition` attribute, and that you cannot chain `c_if` "
"calls on the output of a "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" gate-creating method call.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ini juga berarti bahwa "
"[`Instruction`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.Instruction)"
" tidak lagi memiliki atribut `condition`, dan kamu tidak bisa merantai "
"panggilan `c_if` pada output dari pemanggilan metode pembuatan Gate di "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only instructions that might have a condition now are [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) and [`WhileLoopOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.WhileLoopOp).\n"
"The most correct way to test for a condition is to use an `isinstance` check to validate that you have the correct class.\n"
"If you want to support the legacy `Instruction.condition` attribute during your library's transition to Qiskit v2.0 and later, you can use `getattr(operation, \"condition\", None)`, which will typically cause `Instruction` instances to behave as they did in Qiskit v1.x and earlier.\n"
msgstr ""
"Satu-satunya instruksi yang mungkin memiliki kondisi sekarang adalah [`IfElseOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) dan [`WhileLoopOp`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.WhileLoopOp).\n"
"Cara paling tepat untuk menguji kondisi adalah menggunakan pengecekan `isinstance` untuk memvalidasi bahwa kamu punya kelas yang benar.\n"
"Jika kamu ingin mendukung atribut `Instruction.condition` lama selama transisi library-mu ke Qiskit v2.0 dan seterusnya, kamu bisa menggunakan `getattr(operation, \"condition\", None)`, yang biasanya akan membuat instance `Instruction` berperilaku seperti di Qiskit v1.x dan sebelumnya.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The original, legacy method of supporting simple register-equality conditions in Qiskit was to use the `c_if` method on individual instructions or instruction sets.\n"
"This was strictly less featureful than the full control-flow form, and was never well-supported on hardware.\n"
"This legacy method has been removed in Qiskit v2.0; you should use the [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) method with a proper condition.\n"
"You can continue to use the 2-tuple form of `(register, integer)` to represent a register equality, or you can use the more expressive [classical computation subsystem](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) to represent more complex conditions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Metode lama dan asli untuk mendukung kondisi kesetaraan register sederhana di Qiskit adalah menggunakan metode `c_if` pada instruksi individual atau set instruksi.\n"
"Cara ini secara ketat lebih sedikit fiturnya dibandingkan bentuk control-flow penuh, dan tidak pernah didukung dengan baik pada hardware.\n"
"Metode lama ini sudah dihapus di Qiskit v2.0; kamu harus menggunakan metode [`if_test`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.if_test) dengan kondisi yang tepat.\n"
"Kamu masih bisa menggunakan bentuk 2-tuple `(register, integer)` untuk merepresentasikan kesetaraan register, atau menggunakan [subsistem komputasi klasik](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_classical) yang lebih ekspresif untuk merepresentasikan kondisi yang lebih kompleks.\n"

